  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered the dueling tricks of the sword lords.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aldori Dueling Mastery<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on initiative checks increases to +4 when you begin combat with a dueling sword in your hand, and you increase the shield bonus to AC granted when using a dueling sword by 1, or by 2 if you are using Combat Expertise or are fighting defensively or using the total defense action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
